Maenifold UI
============

This product (Maenifold UI, located at `ui/` in the maenifold repository) is a
copy-and-own, rebranded fork of the "acp-ui" project.

Original work:
  acp-ui — A cross-platform client for the Agent Client Protocol (ACP)
