preserved in accordance with the MIT License terms.

Modifications by the maenifold project:
  - Rebranded from "acp-ui" to "Maenifold UI".
  - Removed mobile (Android / iOS) scaffolding; retained Desktop (Tauri) and Web.
  - Updated package metadata, Tauri configuration, and documentation.

This client is a standalone ACP UI and has no coupling to the maenifold backend.
